WEBVTT

NOTE Prepared from the supplied on-screen captions; English edited and Chinese editorially translated.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:10% size:90%
DeepFamily

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000 line:10% size:90%
This photograph captures the physical grit of a Samsui woman working on a construction site.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.500 line:10% size:90%
For 140 years, the people of Samsui

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.200 line:10% size:90%
literally laid the physical foundations of early Singapore.

5
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.500 line:10% size:90%
The Samsui Hui Kuan began in 1886

6
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.000 line:10% size:90%
as a mutual aid society for these immigrants.

7
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.500 line:10% size:90%
Today, it operates as a sophisticated cultural institution,

8
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.000 line:10% size:90%
managing real estate, scholarships and ancestral memory.

9
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.500 line:10% size:90%
The executive committee recently secured a permanent future for this community

10
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.500 line:10% size:90%
by acquiring a six-storey, nine-million-dollar headquarters in Geylang.

11
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.500 line:10% size:90%
A major achievement of this new property is the Level 4 Ancestral Hall,

12
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.000 line:10% size:90%
which provides a dedicated, highly organized space for ancestor remembrance.

13
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.000 line:10% size:90%
Visitors can scan a QR code,

14
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.000 line:10% size:90%
directly linked to a tablet to bring up an ancestor's name,

15
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.000 line:10% size:90%
a static photograph and their place in the lineage.

16
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.500 line:10% size:90%
The physical real estate is secure; the names are captured.

17
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.000 line:10% size:90%
But the complex lived experiences of the people behind those names

18
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.500 line:10% size:90%
are still heavily vulnerable to time.

19
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.500 line:10% size:90%
Institutional memorials operate with a specific limitation.

20
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.000 line:10% size:90%
They are highly efficient at recording who an ancestor was,

21
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.000 line:10% size:90%
but they lack the structure to record how they lived

22
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.000 line:10% size:90%
or why they made their specific sacrifices.

23
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.500 line:10% size:90%
The detailed context of migration, hardship and business decisions

24
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.500 line:10% size:90%
lives entirely in the memories of the oldest generation.

25
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:32.000 line:10% size:90%
When they pass, that history disappears permanently.

26
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.000 line:10% size:90%
A memorial serves as a static marker of the past.

27
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.500 line:10% size:90%
Living heritage requires continuous, active interaction

28
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.000 line:10% size:90%
to hold the attention of younger generations.

29
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:45.500 line:10% size:90%
The executive committee faces a practical problem:

30
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:50.500 line:10% size:90%
building an interactive, rigorous heritage system is incredibly resource-intensive.

31
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.500 line:10% size:90%
The association cannot absorb that burden directly.

32
00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:58.000 line:10% size:90%
The DeepFamily living heritage layer addresses this exact gap.

33
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.500 line:10% size:90%
It is a system designed to map migration routes,

34
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:05.500 line:10% size:90%
document core values and verify the individual decisions of a specific lineage.

35
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.000 line:10% size:90%
Executing this requires intense private commitment.

36
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:14.500 line:10% size:90%
A full digital initialization costs a single family approximately $100,000,

37
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.500 line:10% size:90%
along with weeks of rigorous interviews and strict data governance.

38
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.000 line:10% size:90%
The association does not need to fund or manage this software.

39
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:26.000 line:10% size:90%
The strategic decision is simply whether to act as the trusted bridge

40
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.500 line:10% size:90%
for interested families to initiate this preservation before their elders' memories are lost.

41
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.500 line:10% size:90%
This matrix compares the existing Level 4 QR

42
00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:39.000 line:10% size:90%
system directly against the proposed DeepFamily layer, to clarify their distinct roles.

43
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:44.500 line:10% size:90%
On scope, the current system is designed to memorialize a single individual efficiently.

44
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:49.000 line:10% size:90%
DeepFamily maps an entire multi-generational branch ontology.

45
00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:53.500 line:10% size:90%
For evidence, the QR tablets accept standard family inputs.

46
00:02:53.500 --> 00:03:00.000 line:10% size:90%
DeepFamily mandates strict provenance tracking and a formal four-state factual verification protocol.

47
00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:04.000 line:10% size:90%
And regarding media, the current hall provides static photos,

48
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:09.000 line:10% size:90%
while DeepFamily yields a fully interactive, AI-structured historical asset.

49
00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.500 line:10% size:90%
DeepFamily does not replace the QR tablets.

50
00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:19.000 line:10% size:90%
It operates in a completely separate private lane, specifically for families seeking a comprehensive historical record.

51
00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.500 line:10% size:90%
Because individual families fund their own projects

52
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.500 line:10% size:90%
and deploy them to isolated local or cloud workspaces,

53
00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.500 line:10% size:90%
the financial cost to the association is zero.

54
00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:33.000 line:10% size:90%
The association serves exclusively as a cultural facilitator,

55
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:38.000 line:10% size:90%
introducing the capability without assuming the liability of managing private data.

56
00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:42.000 line:10% size:90%
This dual-track strategy protects the association's operating budget

57
00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.000 line:10% size:90%
and honors the massive investment in the new hall,

58
00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:49.500 line:10% size:90%
while simultaneously offering a premium cultural asset to families who value it.

59
00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.500 line:10% size:90%
There is no automated shortcut here.

60
00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:57.000 line:10% size:90%
This layer relies on deep anthropological work, not a magic AI button.

61
00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:02.500 line:10% size:90%
The data collection starts with living elders dedicating time to structured 90-minute interviews,

62
00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:06.000 line:10% size:90%
designed to carefully extract their firsthand experiences.

63
00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.500 line:10% size:90%
Every extracted claim passes through a four-state verification protocol.

64
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.500 line:10% size:90%
Family members must manually review the documentation

65
00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:17.500 line:10% size:90%
and sign off on any factual disputes before the data is committed.

66
00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:23.500 line:10% size:90%
This graph illustrates how the DeepFamily data standards from S01 to S09

67
00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:29.500 line:10% size:90%
transform those raw interviews into a structured digital ontology, using a fictional pilot family.

68
00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:34.000 line:10% size:90%
You can visually trace the generational branches as they extend across geographies,

69
00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:38.500 line:10% size:90%
physically mapping the connections between Guangdong, Malaysia and Singapore.

70
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.500 line:10% size:90%
Every migration event or major business decision is permanently anchored to the specific family member,

71
00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.500 line:10% size:90%
backed by verified documentation.

72
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:52.000 line:10% size:90%
Younger generations use this interface to directly retrieve the exact

73
00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:58.000 line:10% size:90%
core values and principles, the Jia Feng Jia Xun, that guided their ancestors and built their lineage.

74
00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:02.500 line:10% size:90%
The result is a highly secure private digital asset designed to survive

75
00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:05.500 line:10% size:90%
and remain accessible for the next 100 years.

76
00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:10.500 line:10% size:90%
The high friction of the input process is exactly what ensures the final output is irrefutable

77
00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.000 line:10% size:90%
and deeply valuable to the family.

78
00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.000 line:10% size:90%
We recommend starting small.

79
00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:20.500 line:10% size:90%
We are seeking just one voluntary pilot family to prove this methodology works for the membership.

80
00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.000 line:10% size:90%
This checklist outlines the ideal candidate.

81
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:28.500 line:10% size:90%
The family must be willing to invest the required time and the hundred-thousand-dollar budget.

82
00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:33.000 line:10% size:90%
Second, they need available living elders to record their oral histories.

83
00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:40.500 line:10% size:90%
Third, a baseline of physical archives, like letters or old photographs, is needed as foundational evidence.

84
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:45.500 line:10% size:90%
Restricting the rollout to a single pilot directly addresses the executive committee's

85
00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:50.500 line:10% size:90%
valid concerns regarding data sovereignty and Singapore's PDPA regulations.

86
00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:54.500 line:10% size:90%
The selected family retains 100% data sovereignty.

87
00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.500 line:10% size:90%
They hold full export rights at all times,

88
00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:01.500 line:10% size:90%
receiving their data on vendor-independent Blu-ray cold storage.

89
00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:05.500 line:10% size:90%
A single, strictly governed pilot isolates the association from financial risk,

90
00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:09.500 line:10% size:90%
while delivering a tangible proof of concept for the broader community.

91
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:14.500 line:10% size:90%
We invite the president and the executive committee to evaluate the membership

92
00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:17.500 line:10% size:90%
and nominate one family to pioneer this effort.

93
00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:23.000 line:10% size:90%
With the family's permission, this verified digital history could serve as a powerful centerpiece

94
00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:26.500 line:10% size:90%
showcase for the 2027 Samsui Cultural Festival.

95
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.500 line:10% size:90%
Preserving ancestors is where heritage begins.

96
00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.500 line:10% size:90%
Connecting generations is how heritage lives.

97
00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:37.500 line:10% size:90%
The 1886 pioneers relied on immense grit to build this community.

98
00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:43.000 line:10% size:90%
The association now has a precise method to secure their stories for 140 years.

99
00:06:43.000 --> 00:07:18.200 line:10% size:90%
DeepFamily
